rightGuess in main
rightGuess invokes secret.matches
rightGuess arg secret secret.Secret hidden lend
rightGuess arg candidate String password lend
rightGuess out right Bool
rightGuess ownedBy none
rightGuess cleanedBy none
rightGuess borrows none
rightGuess catch none

